Source: libavcodec-test
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: MediaArea.net SARL <info@mediaarea.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 12), dpkg-dev, make, gcc, ffmpeg-ma-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: libavcodec-test
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: FFmpeg decoding test tool with patches from MediaArea.net
 Decodes a file through the libav*-ma and libsw*-ma libraries and reports
 the decoding throughput.
 .
 This package contains the dec_tx_test command line tool.
